{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Paradise Beyond the Nightmare&quot; is a 2D exploration horror game where you explore and solve puzzles in a 2D space with depth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The trial version lasts approximately 30 to 40 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The full version will also include chase events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Game Content</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In &quot;Paradise Beyond the Nightmare,&quot; you can explore a spooky storybook-like world both horizontally and vertically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978650/extras/892af57e8427c13bc5713c85bbbb51e5.poster.avif?t=1758286356\" width=1170 height=662 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978650/extras/892af57e8427c13bc5713c85bbbb51e5.webm?t=1758286356\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978650/extras/892af57e8427c13bc5713c85bbbb51e5.mp4?t=1758286356\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While exploring, exclamation marks and other symbols will frequently appear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left-clicking will cause conversation events and mouse events to occur.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978650/extras/6afd4d2b0c2aca1faefb9f81fd64484a.avif?t=1758286356\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Conversation Event&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978650/extras/5c87567345fdf139cd6dd58134093711.avif?t=1758286356\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Mouse Events&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978650/extras/5d897937e0c49f0ce2952ea5de11ea8b.poster.avif?t=1758286356\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978650/extras/5d897937e0c49f0ce2952ea5de11ea8b.webm?t=1758286356\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978650/extras/5d897937e0c49f0ce2952ea5de11ea8b.mp4?t=1758286356\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are also a wide variety of other &quot;mouse events&quot; available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978650/extras/55adda5e61444de6186c5b0c09ea495a.poster.avif?t=1758286356\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978650/extras/55adda5e61444de6186c5b0c09ea495a.webm?t=1758286356\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978650/extras/55adda5e61444de6186c5b0c09ea495a.mp4?t=1758286356\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A succubus with amnesia wanders into a nightmare and relives a young girl's nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Recommended for:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For those who aren't good at games but enjoy solving puzzles and exploring. For those who want to enjoy the atmosphere of a light-hearted horror game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\